{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"tactile auditory substitution tactile auditory substitution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","fileName":"Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Tactile Auditory Substitution","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-28 03:04\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Tactile Communication and Sensory Substitution]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Tactile Communication and Sensory Substitution","haptics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"tactile auditory substitution tactile auditory substitution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","fileName":"Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Tactile Auditory Substitution","heading":"Tactile Auditory Substitution","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Tactile auditory substitution translates environmental sound or speech features into time-varying stimulation on the skin. A wearable can encode a knock, alarm, or baby's cry as a distinct vibration pattern, or represent syllable timing and phonetic features to support speech reading.\n\nThe mapping from an acoustic feature to a tactile cue is usually arbitrary, so users need systematic, long-term training. Touch has useful temporal resolution but cannot reproduce the ear's full bandwidth or waveform analysis. Effective systems select a limited set of meaningful features rather than attempting to transmit the entire sound signal.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Tactile Communication and Sensory Substitution","haptics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"tactile auditory substitution tactile auditory substitution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","fileName":"Tactile Auditory Substitution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Tactile Auditory Substitution","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[haptics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Tactile Communication and Sensory Substitution","haptics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}